        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Minion-Maker description (p87) says that minions only last for the current scene. Then it says:&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\"You may be able to have more permanent helpers based on story development; see pages&nbsp;142-143 for details.\"</p>\r\n\r\n<p>But pages 142-143 (Hero Advancement) say nothing about permanent helpers.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Any suggestions?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The best I can come up with is to allow spending a collection to start a scene with a minion, for scenes where that makes sense (heroes at scene for a while before action starts).</p>",
