      {
        "id": 233763,
        "name": "GeorgeDubya",
        "username": "GeorgeDubya",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/b487fb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-09-13T14:06:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's actually on page 248 Alternate Rewards. Basically using your hero points for a Minion of size based on points spent - 2 points = d4, 3 = d6, 4 = d8, 5 = d10. Minion acts at the start of your turn as normal, and if it survives a scene, it can recover one die size automatically. If it gets knocked out, it's out for the session.</p>",
